  {
    "command": "set_background",
    "display_name": "廊下",
    "id": "7",
    "timezone": "3"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "ひよの",
    "text": "「はい、はい。そうですぅ、わたしと同じ生徒会役員の……副会長のともこさん。」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "ひよの",
    "text": "「どこかで見かけたら、わたしに連絡をお願いしますね」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 26,
    "dress": "old-new",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-new_expression/joyful",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 4,
      "y": 472
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "ひよの",
    "text": "「えぇ、はい。わかりました、よろしくお願いしますぅ♪」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 26,
    "dress": "old-new",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-new_expression/normal",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 4,
      "y": 472
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "ひよの",
    "text": "（うん。新聞部の、新入部員の子たちともちゃんとコミュニケーションとれてる……気がしますぅ。）"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 26,
    "dress": "old-new",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-new_expression/sad",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 4,
      "y": 472
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "ひよの",
    "text": "（もっと、ふみさんみたいに厳しくすべきなんでしょうけど）"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 26,
    "dress": "old-new",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-new_expression/amazed",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 4,
      "y": 472
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "ひよの",
    "text": "（どうしても卑屈に、ペコペコしちゃう癖が抜けませんね〜？）"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 26,
    "dress": "old-new",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-new_expression/sad",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 4,
      "y": 472
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "ひよの",
    "text": "（わたしが部長なんですから、いちばん偉そうにしてないと。）"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 26,
    "dress": "old-new",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-new_expression/joyful",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 4,
      "y": 472
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "ひよの",
    "text": "（もっと、ふみさんみたいに『むふん♪』って胸張って）"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 26,
    "dress": "old-new",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-new_expression/sad",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 4,
      "y": 472
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "ひよの",
    "text": "（ん〜……似合わないですね、わたし猫背だからなぁ。どうしても、おどおど上目遣いになっちゃいますぅ）"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "ひよの",
    "text": "（こういう、性分ですし……。わたしなりに、何とかやっていくしかないですよね）"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 26,
    "dress": "old-new",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-new_expression/surprise",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 4,
      "y": 472
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "ひよの",
    "text": "（でも……。新入部員の子たち、『グラウンドにきてください』ってどういうことでしょう？）"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 26,
    "dress": "old-new",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-new_expression/amazed",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 4,
      "y": 472
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "ひよの",
    "text": "（何か良からぬことを考えてるんじゃないでしょうか、う〜ん？）"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 26,
    "dress": "old-new",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-new_expression/sad",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 4,
      "y": 472
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "ひよの",
    "text": "（勝手に動くな、って叱るべき？）"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "ひよの",
    "text": "（いやでも、わたしが生徒会のお仕事もやってて忙しそうだからって……。気ぃ遣って、報告しなかったのかも？）"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 26,
    "dress": "old-new",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-new_expression/surprise",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 4,
      "y": 472
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "ひよの",
    "text": "（グラウンドかぁ、そういえば何だか外が騒がしいですね。）"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 26,
    "dress": "old-new",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-new_expression/amazed",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 4,
      "y": 472
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "ひよの",
    "text": "（『新入生懇親会』のお客さん、保護者の方々とかが帰りかけてるから……だと思ってましたけど？）"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "ひよの",
    "text": "（どうも、遠目だからわかりにくいけど屋台みたいなのがでてるような？）"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 26,
    "dress": "old-new",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-new_expression/sad",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 4,
      "y": 472
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "ひよの",
    "text": "（音楽も聞こえてきますし……ん〜、そんな出し物をするっていう報告は聞いてませんけど？）"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "ひよの",
    "text": "（駄目ですね、よく見えません。目ぇ悪くなっちゃってるなぁ、もっと早く前髪をあげとけばよかった。）"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 26,
    "dress": "old-new",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-new_expression/amazed",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 4,
      "y": 472
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "ひよの",
    "text": "（ただでさえ、書き物ばっかりして近視ぎみなのに〜？）"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 26,
    "dress": "old-new",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-new_expression/joyful",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 4,
      "y": 472
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "ひよの",
    "text": "（眼鏡、買いに行きましょうかね。こう、上司っぽく、先輩っぽく見えるような知的なやつを……♪）"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 26,
    "dress": "old-new",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-new_expression/surprise",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 4,
      "y": 472
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "ひよの",
    "text": "「うひゃん!?」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "ひよの",
    "text": "「す、すみません。余所見しながら歩いたらいけませんね、ぶつかっちゃいましたぁ……って会長さん？」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 26,
    "dress": "old-new",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-new_expression/joyful",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 4,
      "y": 472
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "ひよの",
    "text": "「お仕事、お疲れさまですぅ♪」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 26,
    "dress": "old-new",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-new_expression/normal",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 4,
      "y": 472
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "ひよの",
    "text": "「はい、こちらはほぼ想定内という感じですよぅ。あとで、報告書をつくって提出しますね？」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 26,
    "dress": "old-new",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-new_expression/amazed",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 4,
      "y": 472
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "ひよの",
    "text": "「そちらは忙しそうですね〜、相変わらず。倒れちゃったりしないように、気をつけてくださいね。」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 26,
    "dress": "old-new",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-new_expression/joyful",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 4,
      "y": 472
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "ひよの",
    "text": "「もっと、わたしたちを頼ってくれてもいいんですよぅ♪」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 26,
    "dress": "old-new",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-new_expression/sad",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 4,
      "y": 472
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "ひよの",
    "text": "「……何を企んでいるのか、知りませんけど。一言ぐらい、相談してくださいね」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 26,
    "dress": "old-new",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-new_expression/normal",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 4,
      "y": 472
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "ひよの",
    "text": "「なつみさんや、ともこさんには言いにくいことでも……。」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "ひよの",
    "text": "「わたしにだったら、気兼ねなく相談しちゃっていいですからね」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 26,
    "dress": "old-new",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-new_expression/sad",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 4,
      "y": 472
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "ひよの",
    "text": "「生徒会の役員としては、あんまりドタバタ騒ぎが起きちゃうのは歓迎できませんけど。」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 26,
    "dress": "old-new",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-new_expression/joyful",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 4,
      "y": 472
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "ひよの",
    "text": "「新聞部の部長としては、校内の秩序が乱れてくれたほうが都合がいいので……♪」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 26,
    "dress": "old-new",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-new_expression/sad",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 4,
      "y": 472
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "ひよの",
    "text": "「わたし、もしかしたら獅子身中の虫かもしれませんね」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "ひよの",
    "text": "「なつみさんみたいに、あなたとは気心が知れてはいません。」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "ひよの",
    "text": "「ともこさんのように、あなたの片腕として、肩を並べて戦うこともできません」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 26,
    "dress": "old-new",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-new_expression/normal",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 4,
      "y": 472
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "ひよの",
    "text": "「だからこそ。ふたりが遠慮しちゃって言えないようなこと、いっぱい言っちゃいますぅ。」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 26,
    "dress": "old-new",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-new_expression/joyful",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 4,
      "y": 472
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "ひよの",
    "text": "「ううん記事にしちゃいますからね、面白おかしく……あることないこと♪」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 26,
    "dress": "old-new",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-new_expression/normal",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 4,
      "y": 472
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "ひよの",
    "text": "「そういうひとも、必要かなって。周りがぜんぶイエスマンだらけだったら、まちがっちゃっても気づきませんから。」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "ひよの",
    "text": "「客観的に、公平に、あなたの行為を記事にします」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "ひよの",
    "text": "「是非を判断するのは、生徒の皆さんですけど。そういう視点があることも、覚えていてくださいね」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 26,
    "dress": "old-new",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-new_expression/sad",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 4,
      "y": 472
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "ひよの",
    "text": "「お急ぎでしょう、引き留めちゃってすみません。」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 26,
    "dress": "old-new",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-new_expression/joyful",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 4,
      "y": 472
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "ひよの",
    "text": "「今後も、わたしたちの青春の中心で……。全力で輝いてくださいね、会長さん♪」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "ひよの",
    "text": "（……行っちゃった。ほんと、いつもドタバタしてるひと。でも面白いひとですよね〜、物語の主人公みたい。）"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 26,
    "dress": "old-new",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-new_expression/normal",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 4,
      "y": 472
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "ひよの",
    "text": "（今後も騒ぎの中心点を、特等席から眺めさせてくださいね）"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "ひよの",
    "text": "（さてと。グラウンドに行きましょうかね〜、呼びだされちゃいましたし。）"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "ひよの",
    "text": "（ともこさんも恥ずかしがってどこかに隠れちゃったのか、目撃情報もありませんし）"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "ひよの",
    "text": "（会長さんも、そちらへ向かっているようですし。）"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 26,
    "dress": "old-new",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-new_expression/joyful",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 4,
      "y": 472
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "ひよの",
    "text": "（おかしな事態が発生してるのに、見過ごしたとあっては……ふみさんに怒られちゃいますよぅ♪）"
  }
]